      "description": "One habit, seven ruled date boxes; today lime-ringed; done days crossed off in the habit marker, part-done slashed.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-board\"><div class=\"ds-bn\">Read 20 pages <span>3/5</span></div><button class=\"ds-bd\"><span class=\"ds-faded\">21</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" class=\"ds-marker\" style=\"color:#7cc7ff\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-stroke\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M8.5 9.5c6.5 5.4 15 13.2 23 21.8\"/><path class=\"ds-stroke ds-stroke-2\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M31.5 8.8C24 15 16.4 22.3 8.8 31\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-bd\"><span>22</span></button><button class=\"ds-bd\"><span class=\"ds-faded\">23</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" class=\"ds-marker\" style=\"color:#7cc7ff\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-stroke\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M8.5 9.5c6.5 5.4 15 13.2 23 21.8\"/><path class=\"ds-stroke ds-stroke-2\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M31.5 8.8C24 15 16.4 22.3 8.8 31\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-bd\" data-partial><span class=\"ds-faded\">24</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" class=\"ds-marker\" style=\"color:#7cc7ff\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-stroke\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M30.5 9.5C23.5 16 16.5 23 9.5 30.5\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-bd\"><span class=\"ds-faded\">25</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" class=\"ds-marker\" style=\"color:#7cc7ff\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-stroke\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M8.5 9.5c6.5 5.4 15 13.2 23 21.8\"/><path class=\"ds-stroke ds-stroke-2\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M31.5 8.8C24 15 16.4 22.3 8.8 31\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-bd\" data-today><span>26</span></button><button class=\"ds-bd\" disabled><span>27</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-board{font-family:\"Archivo Variable\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));border:1px solid var(--line,#26262c);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface,#141417);color:var(--ink,#f4f4f5)}.ds-bn{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:.6rem .75rem .4rem;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600}.ds-bn span{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--dim,#8b8b95);font-stretch:82%;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-bd{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;height:3rem;border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#26262c);border-left:1px solid var(--line,#26262c);background:transparent;font:inherit;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;font-stretch:80%;color:var(--dim,#8b8b95);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease}.ds-bd:nth-of-type(1){border-left:0}.ds-bd:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--surface-2,#1a1a1e)}.ds-bd:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent-text,#d3ff3e);outline-offset:-2px}.ds-bd[data-today]{background:var(--accent-soft,rgb(211 255 62/.12));color:var(--accent-text,#d3ff3e);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--accent-text,#d3ff3e)}.ds-bd[data-partial]{color:var(--ink,#f4f4f5)}.ds-bd:disabled{color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--dim,#8b8b95) 45%,transparent);cursor:default}.ds-faded{opacity:.35}.ds-marker{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;overflow:visible}.ds-stroke{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:4.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:.94;animation:ds-draw 150ms cubic-bezier(.3,.6,.2,1) both}.ds-stroke-2{animation-delay:120ms}@keyframes ds-draw{from{stroke-dashoffset:1}}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-stroke{animation:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tick Box",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "tick-box",
      "description": "The one way done looks: a small box crossed off with the marker X.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-tick\"></span> <span class=\"ds-tick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" class=\"ds-marker\" style=\"color:var(--accent,#d3ff3e)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-stroke\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M8.5 9.5c6.5 5.4 15 13.2 23 21.8\"/><path class=\"ds-stroke ds-stroke-2\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M31.5 8.8C24 15 16.4 22.3 8.8 31\"/></svg></span>",
